        },
        {
          "text": "Ni kubg’ ivyo Uhoraho ashamaje kugira ngw abagirire ubuntu, kandi ni kubg’ ivyo azohaguruka kugira ngw abagirire ikigongwe, kuk’ Uhoraho ar’ Imana ica izibereye; hahirwa abashamaje bamwiteze bose.",
          "type": "text",
