            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umuco w’ukwezi uzomera nk’uw’ izuba, kand’ umuco w’izuba uzokwongerekanywa ibihetangabo ndwi, ungane n’umuco wo mu misi ndwi, ku musi Uhoraho azopfuka ibikomere vy’abantu biwe, akavūra n’inguma yabakubise.",
          "type": "text",
