              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eh’ izina ry’Uhoraho riraza rivuye kure, rirurumbamw’ uburake bgiwe, ripfundukamw’ umwotsi w’intunda: iminwa yiwe yuzuye ubushangashirwe, kand’ ururimi rwiwe rumeze nk’umuriro utongora: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
